Prompts.Formatting:
[FORMATTING] Respond with JSON in this EXACT structure (no markdown, no preamble, nothing more than this JSON):
{
  "message": "Your introduction message (2-3 sentences)",
  "quickReplies": [
    {
      "id": "intent_name",
      "label": "Emoji + User-friendly label",
      "value": "Phrase the user would say to activate this intent"
    }
  ]
}
Order the quick replies alphabetically by their intent.

[FORMATTING] Respond ONLY with JSON in this EXACT format (no markdown, no preamble, nothing more than this JSON):
{
  "text": "the rewritten message",
  "quickReplies": [ { "id": "...", "label": "...", "value": "..." } ]
}

If the rewrite has no quick replies to expose (because supportsQuickReplies is false, or the original had none), set 'quickReplies' to null.
